cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper."
title: "A mutation-aware search of 375 cancer cell-line proteomes recovers 53 of 8,470 acquired-lysine observations: code and deposited data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and panel-level deposited data for a study of mutation-created ("acquired")
  lysines as a covalent target class: their catalogue across DepMap, TCGA and COSMIC; a
  mutation-aware re-search of 42 published CCLE TMT proteomes; burden-matched entrapment to
  measure the realised false-discovery proportion within the variant class; and an analysis of
  what governs lysine reactivity and ligandability across three chemoproteomic screens.
type: software
authors:
